    "current_example": {
      "math_academy_id": "e-3375",
      "problem": "Which of the following values is in the range of $y=\\sec x?$\n\nI. $0$\n\nII. $1$\n\nIII. $2$",
      "worked_solution": "Let's recall the graph of $y=\\sec x.$\n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/linear/14254588/assets/37725a42df9b709dbef121957bc5d177e50ebb682e6bc97bbff8373768f7be11.png)\n\nNote that the range of the function is $(-\\infty, -1] \\cup [1, \\infty),$ so $y=\\sec x$ takes any value $y\\leq -1$ and any value $y\\geq 1.$\n\nTherefore, the values $y=1$ and $y=2$ belong to the range, $y=0$ is not in the range.",
